     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"rtl\"><div>אחלה, תודה רבה...</div>\r\n<div>איציק<br>בתאריך יום שלישי, 17 בפברואר 2015 בשעה 16:56:26 UTC+2, מאת Tal Galili:</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"BORDER-LEFT:#ccc 1px solid;MARGIN:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;PADDING-LEFT:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">לא שמוכר לי.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">ואגב, מדובר בקורס שלא כולל סטטיסטיקה (לפחות כשבדקתי אותו בזמנו). </div>\r\n</span><div><br clear=\"all\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:----------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>---<span><br>Contact me: <a rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00a6A3sPQ8sUbFQJ1bd5bg\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NE9Nm1xkfKarvEJ66BHn7\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2c9JLJNjj6EL02bQ0BxBpN\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>------------------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>----<br><br></span></div></div></div><div><div><br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">2015-02-17 16:44 GMT+02:00 Itzik <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">tzok...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br>\r\n<blockquote style=\"BORDER-LEFT:#ccc 1px solid;MARGIN:0px 0.8ex;PADDING-LEFT:1ex;PADDING-RIGHT:1ex;BORDER-RIGHT:#ccc 1px solid\" class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n<div>תודה, האם ניתן למצוא קורס מקביל לא בחוג לסטטיסטיקה (על משקל פיזיקה 1 לכימאיים, אשר לומדים ברמה גבוהה אך לא כמו שנדש מהסטודנטים לפיזיקה).</div>\r\n<div>איציק</div>\r\n<div><br>בתאריך יום שלישי, 17 בפברואר 2015 בשעה 16:25:07 UTC+2, מאת Tal Galili:</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"BORDER-LEFT:#ccc 1px solid;MARGIN:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;PADDING-LEFT:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">יש את &quot;מבוא למחשבים לסטטיסטיקאים&quot; שנלמד ב-R.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\"><a href=\"http://www2.tau.ac.il/yedion/syllabus.asp?course=0365180001\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www2.tau.ac.il/yedion/syllabus.asp?course%3D0365180001&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Nr7JC30yJyaTNoiTiPVhM\">http://www2.tau.ac.il/yedion/<u></u>s<u></u>yllabus.asp?course=0365180001</a><br></div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">(למרות שהסילבוס טוען שזה בשפת C)</div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div></div></span>\r\n<div><br clear=\"all\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:----------------------<u></u><u></u>------------------------------<u></u><u></u>---<br>Contact me: <a rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br><span>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00a6A3sPQ8sUbFQJ1bd5bg\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NE9Nm1xkfKarvEJ66BHn7\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2c9JLJNjj6EL02bQ0BxBpN\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>------------------------------<u></u><u></u>------------------------------<u></u><u></u>------------------------------<u></u><u></u>----<br><br></span></div></div></div><span><br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Feb 17, 2015 at 4:21 PM, Itzik <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">tzok...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote style=\"BORDER-LEFT:#ccc 1px solid;MARGIN:0px 0.8ex;PADDING-LEFT:1ex;PADDING-RIGHT:1ex;BORDER-RIGHT:#ccc 1px solid\" class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n<div>ברמה של מתחילים.</div>\r\n<div><br>בתאריך יום שני, 16 בפברואר 2015 בשעה 16:29:11 UTC+2, מאת Tal Galili:</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"BORDER-LEFT:#ccc 1px solid;MARGIN:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;PADDING-LEFT:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"DIRECTION:rtl\"><span>יש הרבה קורסים. באיזה רמה?</span></div><br><span>Sent from a smart-phone</span></div></span><span>\r\n<div><br>On 16 בפבר 2015, at 16:24, Itzik &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">tzok...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br><br></div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n<div>שלום,</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>האם מישהו יודע האם יש קורס ב-R באוניברסיטת תל-אביב?</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>תודה,</div>\r\n<div>איציק</div></div>\r\n<p></p>-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+<u></u>unsubscrib<u></u><u></u>e...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MWd-flMSC_FmfIrvdAjlL\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>op<u></u><u></u>tout</a>.<br></div></blockquote></span></div></blockquote></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p></p>-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+<u></u>unsubscrib<u></u>e...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MWd-flMSC_FmfIrvdAjlL\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>op<u></u>tout</a>.<br></div></div></blockquote></div><br></span></div></blockquote></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p></p>-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+<u></u>unsub...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497527461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MWd-flMSC_FmfIrvdAjlL\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>optout</a>.<br></div></div></blockquote></div><br></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div>"
